    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/3e7dd37443c2a95dbf9f9763668d73b6.poster.avif?t=1730991912\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/3e7dd37443c2a95dbf9f9763668d73b6.webm?t=1730991912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/3e7dd37443c2a95dbf9f9763668d73b6.mp4?t=1730991912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Flower is an enchanting adventure that invites you to explore a beautifully hand-drawn world, control three unique characters, and solve intriguing puzzles\u2014all without a single word of text or dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Drawn Animations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character and background is lovingly crafted with hand-drawn animation. Enjoy numerous beautifully animated cutscenes. Each frame of animation is created with care and passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/f891b80ad08edf5376b8fb06234f3981.poster.avif?t=1730991912\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/f891b80ad08edf5376b8fb06234f3981.webm?t=1730991912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/f891b80ad08edf5376b8fb06234f3981.mp4?t=1730991912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Three Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story from the perspectives of three unique characters. See how their different viewpoints changes the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wordless Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no text or dialogue, Dear Flower allows you to craft your own emotional journey as you interpret the story and world in your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Sound Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The carefully crafted soundscape enhances the atmosphere, bringing the characters and environments to life and drawing you deeper into the world of Dear Flower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/0629c0aec33ea5b519ac1edece2a85e2.poster.avif?t=1730991912\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/0629c0aec33ea5b519ac1edece2a85e2.webm?t=1730991912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/0629c0aec33ea5b519ac1edece2a85e2.mp4?t=1730991912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by \u201cCRIWARE\u201d.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/3e7dd37443c2a95dbf9f9763668d73b6.poster.avif?t=1730991912\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/3e7dd37443c2a95dbf9f9763668d73b6.webm?t=1730991912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/3e7dd37443c2a95dbf9f9763668d73b6.mp4?t=1730991912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Flower is an enchanting adventure that invites you to explore a beautifully hand-drawn world, control three unique characters, and solve intriguing puzzles\u2014all without a single word of text or dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Drawn Animations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character and background is lovingly crafted with hand-drawn animation. Enjoy numerous beautifully animated cutscenes. Each frame of animation is created with care and passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/f891b80ad08edf5376b8fb06234f3981.poster.avif?t=1730991912\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/f891b80ad08edf5376b8fb06234f3981.webm?t=1730991912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/f891b80ad08edf5376b8fb06234f3981.mp4?t=1730991912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Three Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story from the perspectives of three unique characters. See how their different viewpoints changes the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wordless Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no text or dialogue, Dear Flower allows you to craft your own emotional journey as you interpret the story and world in your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Sound Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The carefully crafted soundscape enhances the atmosphere, bringing the characters and environments to life and drawing you deeper into the world of Dear Flower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/0629c0aec33ea5b519ac1edece2a85e2.poster.avif?t=1730991912\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/0629c0aec33ea5b519ac1edece2a85e2.webm?t=1730991912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675900/extras/0629c0aec33ea5b519ac1edece2a85e2.mp4?t=1730991912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by \u201cCRIWARE\u201d.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</p>",
